{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c3d1","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b1e4-390b-7943-9137-5d4864ee30d9"},"sequence":67,"recorded_at":1780531400000129,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"dd82b03b-72d2-4612-983d-4c763e9197c6","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"dd82b03b-72d2-4612-983d-4c763e9197c6","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"dd82b03b-72d2-4612-983d-4c763e9197c6"},"call_id":"call_01a0b1e458157046801e1681bb2d9071","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/resources/TASK-260830-24z2b3/TASK-260830-24z2b3_producer.md`.\n1|Own TASK-260830-24z2b3 (implement-clone-bundle-and-canonical-session-types), first leaf of STORY-260830-1cyj0q (canonical-session-capture-and-evidence, EPIC M4; siblings 2g5be6 and 32ypr2 follow). Implement, as production code over the landed internal/sessadapter protocol/context owners and canonicaljson closed shapes, the cross-environment clone capture contracts of the pinned Section 13.14.1 (Clone Raw Object Manifest 1.0.0 — closed: schema/version/omission-rule ID, operation ID, source Environment Tuple, sorted unique entries with sanitized native key, capture class, byte count, blob ID, Blob Descriptor ID, extensions; no credential/runtime/lock/target/AX-lease/fabricated identity; Clone Capture Manifest 1.0.0 — schema/version/ID, operation/bundle, source basis ax_session|external_native, source Environment Tuple, sanitized Native Identity, capture-plan digest, Capture Boundary stable|unstable_archive, Raw Object Manifest ID, sorted Capture Items with the closed class vocabulary durable_payload|durable_index_required|durable_sidecar|derived_cache_optional|credential|machine_auth|runtime_state|transient_lock|unknown and the included/excluded rule, exact excluded classes, core-derived raw_complete, creator/time, extensions; the Canonical Session and Canonical Event types, raw evidence des